Package: DARELL
Type: Package
Title: Distributionally Adaptive Regression Estimator under Local Linear
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Shengtao", "Dai", email = "shengtao.dai@bc.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements the local linear version of the distributionally
    adaptive regression estimator (DARE) of Dai (2025)
    <https://ssrn.com/abstract=5683602>. The conditional mean at a target
    point is estimated by a weighted combination of local linear quantile
    estimates, with weights built from estimated conditional densities and the
    number of quantiles chosen by cross-validation. Under regularity
    conditions the estimator attains the asymptotic variance of the infeasible
    likelihood-based estimator while keeping the convergence rate of
    conventional estimators, so it stays efficient when errors are heavy-tailed
    or non-Gaussian. A confidence interval is returned with the estimate.
